Infer an augmented assignment that uses an in-place operator of a builtin mutable
type (``list.__iadd__``, ``set.__ior__``, ``dict.__ior__``, ...) on an instance as
that instance, when the right operand is a literal. Previously the assignment was
uninferable, so attributes assigned on ``self`` afterwards were not recorded and
pylint reported ``no-member`` for them.

Refs #3372
Closes pylint-dev/pylint#10031
